{c: Verse 1}
[F#m]Rajanigadha [A]phool tumhare,        [D]Mahake yun hi [F#m]jeewan mein
[A]Yu hi maheke [D]preet piya ki,        [A]Mere anuraagi [F#m]mann mein
[F#]Adhikaar ye jabase [B]saajan Ka,        har [E]dhadakan par [A]maana maine
[F#]Mai jabse unake [B]saath bandhi,        [E]Ye bhed tabhi [A]jaana maine
[E]Kitana sukh hai [F#m]bandhan me,        [F#m]Rajanigadha [A]phool tumhare...
[F#]Har pal meri in [B]aankho mein,        [E]Bas rahate hai [A]sapane unake
[F#]Mann kaheta hai [B]main rango,        [E]Ki ek pyar bhari [A]badali bankar
[E]Barasu unake [F#m]jeewan mein,        [F#m]Rajanigadha [A]phool tumhare..
